   <div class=\"empty-food\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid-row day2\">\n      <div class=\"time-cell day-label\">第2天</div>\n      <div class=\"route-cell route\">\n        <span class=\"bold\">马鞍山堂里</span>→<span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <span class=\"bold\">中山四路文化街区</span>→<span class=\"small-note\">地铁/打车</span>→ <span class=\"bold\">鹅岭公园</span>→鹅岭二厂→李子坝→磁器口古镇→北仓文创园→<span class=\"green\">🌄</span>不夜九街\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"empty-food\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid-row day3\">\n      <div class=\"time-cell day-label\">第3天</div>\n      <div class=\"route-cell route\">\n        <span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <span class=\"bold\">山城第三步道</span>→十八梯→白象居→湖广会馆→东水门城墙→越江长江索道/两江怀旧游轮（2选1）→<span class=\"bold\">龙门浩老街</span>→弹子石老街→南滨游艇广场→南滨路→<span class=\"green\">🌄</span> <span class=\"bold\">南山一棵树·夜景</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"empty-food\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid-row day4\">\n      <div class=\"day4-side\">\n        <div class=\"red-badge\">\n          <div class=\"badge-text\">第<br>4<br>天</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"swap-note\">可根据情况替换！</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"route-cell day4-content\">\n        <div class=\"day4-route\">\n          <span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <span class=\"bold\">渣滓洞白公馆</span>→<span class=\"bold\">磁器口古镇</span>→打车马房湾七彩巷→<span class=\"bold\">罗中立美术馆</span>→<span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <span class=\"bold\">黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</span>→交通茶馆→铁路四村\n        </div>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title green-title\">✅渣滓洞白公馆景区</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"clock\">⏰</span>9:00-16:30&nbsp; 网上实名制预约</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\">烈士墓、渣滓洞、白公馆 往返专车，每人20元</p>\n          <div class=\"arrow-title\">→渣滓洞</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">原为人工开采小煤窑，1920年由资本家程尔昌所建，后煤窑被军统所霸占改造成监狱。</p>\n          <div class=\"arrow-title\">→白公馆</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">原为四川军阀白驹郊外别墅，白驹自诩是白居易的后代，<br>1939年军统特务头子戴笠，改造为迫害革命家的监狱。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title gold-title\">◆磁器口古镇</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">商业化严重，但是可以一看</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\">重庆非常有名的古镇，感受这座城市历史和古韵，还有各种各样的小吃，</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title gold-title\">▶马房湾七彩巷（网红打卡）</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">童话世界中的彩色王国，房子都被涂成了五颜六色，明星涂鸦墙</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title green-title\">✅罗中立美术馆</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"clock\">⏰</span>9:30-16:30（周一闭馆）免费 微信“四川美院美术馆”预约</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\">川美黄桷坪校区，面积最大的美术馆，旁边是大学城有名黑街</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title green-title\">✅黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">川美黄桷坪校区，这条街上从楼房、墙面、到校园、店铺等满满的涂鸦</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section tea\">\n          <div class=\"section-title\">◆交通茶馆</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">一杯茶10元&nbsp; 黄桷坪正街4号</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\">始于1987年，保持上世纪七八十年代风格，水泥地面、红砖柱头、四方桌、条凳、青花茶碗...喝茶嗑瓜子打麻将摆龙门阵。电影《疯狂的石头》取景</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-title\">◆铁路四村</div>\n          <p class=\"detail\">废弃的铁轨上长满了绿色植物，瞬间掉入宫崎骏动画的感觉<br>有一家军哥书屋约二手书店。</p>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"empty-food\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
